  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 131e1dca5f7f2ca42be00771cea61f30, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafeStreets.Conversation
  speakerName: Guard Gus
  lines:
  - Morning! I'm Gus, the crossing guard for this school crossing.
  - 'My job is easy to copy: STOP at the curb, LOOK left-right-left, LISTEN, then
    cross when it is clear.'
  - If I hold my paddle up, that means STOP - even if you do not see a car.
  - Want to practise? Little Sam is waiting by the park path. Walk him across the
    stripes for me.
  closingTip: Rules from the K-12 Traffic Safety Education Resource Guide
